00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.240
Thank you for coming.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:07.340
My name is Matt Tai.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.416
I'm a product manager with
Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:10.790
And today I'd like
to talk to you

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.081
about accelerating marketing
insight with Google Cloud.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.300
So I do want to level
set everyone, likely need

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.492
to run your business with
facts and not feelings.

00:00:21.492 --> 00:00:22.950
To do that, everyone
knows you have

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:27.880
data you need to get insights
from, to ultimately make money.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:31.060
I mean, that's why
we're all here.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:33.790
So as a business leader, what
are some things I need to do?

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:35.680
I want to get a single
view of my business.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:38.299
I want to invest in my most
