MATTHEW GRANISH: Thank you Matt.

00:06:36.846 --> 00:06:37.470
Good afternoon.

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:40.750
I'm Matthew Granish
from Mercedes-Benz USA.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.829
