00:34:57.650 --> 00:34:59.270
We were to some extent.

00:34:59.270 --> 00:35:01.160
I want to get away from that.

00:35:01.160 --> 00:35:04.890
We want to publish content,
write content, distribute it.

00:35:04.890 --> 00:35:07.670
So some of the things that
drove us to Google Cloud

00:35:07.670 --> 00:35:12.180
in particular was the no
ops attributes of BigQuery.

00:35:12.180 --> 00:35:14.960
Redshift needs some ops.

00:35:14.960 --> 00:35:17.320
We didn't do that very well.

00:35:17.320 --> 00:35:19.490
BigQuery needs no ops.

00:35:19.490 --> 00:35:21.960
So far, it's working out
really, really well for us.

00:35:21.960 --> 00:35:24.251
And we don't need any people
thinking about operations,

00:35:24.251 --> 00:35:26.670
which is amazing.

